<<~ ahu #/meme-header>>

! KAIROS — The Proactive Monitor as an Instrument

Not invariant law. The forks at #ruled carry the operator's rulings of 2026-08-27.

The sibling room at `preferences/proactive-surfacing` holds the recovered ''principle''.
This room holds the ''instrument'' — what a check looks like, how many surface, when they
surface, and what happens to one the operator sets down.

KAIROS keeps its recovered shape throughout: a timing reflex distributed through the house,
never a subsystem bolted beside it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ aka "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/RFC-2119#/normative-language">>

<<~ ahu #/provenance>>

